OL,3,AAustralia investigating Flydubai
OL,4,Aco-pilot's links to country
OL,5,
OL,6,FAustralian authorities are
OL,7,Finvestigating the links between the
OL,8,Fcountry and a Flydubai co-pilot who
OL,9,Fattempted to take control of a plane
OL,10,Ftravelling to Israel.
OL,12,FThe co-pilot is alleged to have
OL,13,Fattacked the captain with a crash axe
OL,14,Fduring a flight from Dubai to Tel Aviv
OL,15,Fbefore passengers managed to overpower
OL,16,Fhim and successfully take control of
OL,17,Fthe plane.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
