OL,3,ATennessee prison chief to resign after
OL,4,AChrista Pike's failed execution
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of prisons in the US state of
OL,7,FTennessee is resigning after the failed
OL,8,Fexecution of death row inmate Christa
OL,9,FPike on Wednesday.
OL,11,FGovernor Bill Lee announced the change
OL,12,Fon Saturday, sharing the news in a
OL,13,Fjoint statement with Tennessee
OL,14,FDepartment of Correction Commissioner
OL,15,FFrank Strada.
OL,17,FStrada said that his stepping down is
OL,18,F"in the best interests" of the state,
OL,19,Fand called the ongoing investigation
OL,20,Finto the incident "entirely appropriate
OL,21,Fand necessary".
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
